[
  {"comment": "Sara's default keymap as a painter's left hand meets it, and against Krita's. The first half reads every row of the Keyboard Shortcuts page under the three shipped profiles, from which a keymap table can be made. The second half strikes each finding on that page with a key step, a state before and after it, and a shot. The six dockers a fresh profile opens are placed first, because the scenario clicks two of their text boxes on purpose."},
